WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.049 --> 00:00:07.332
The wolf is chasing Polly and Jack.

2
00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:17.394
He wants to eat them!

3
00:00:17.395 --> 00:00:19.902
Polly: You're not Granny.

4
00:00:19.903 --> 00:00:23.936
Jack: Where is

5
00:00:23.937 --> 00:00:30.742
Granny? Wolf: In that closet. She's waiting for

6
00:00:30.743 --> 00:00:35.346
dinner. Please join us!

7
00:00:35.347 --> 00:00:38.545
Polly: Run, Jack!

8
00:00:38.546 --> 00:00:49.902
Jack: Polly! Wait for me!

9
00:00:49.903 --> 00:00:55.952
Wolf: Got you, rabbit.

10
00:00:55.953 --> 00:01:00.794
Polly: Let him go!

11
00:01:00.795 --> 00:01:13.083
Jack: Get help, Polly!

12
00:01:13.084 --> 00:01:23.313
Polly: Where can I find help fast? The

13
00:01:23.314 --> 00:01:31.185
woodcutter! Mr. Woodcutter! We need help.

14
00:01:31.186 --> 00:01:36.254
Woodcutter: I'm coming.

15
00:01:36.255 --> 00:01:43.501
Polly: I hope we're not too late!

16
00:01:43.502 --> 00:01:49.416
Oh no! The wolf put Granny and Jack in a pot!

17
00:01:49.417 --> 00:01:57.318
Wolf: Yummy. Two more for dinner!

18
00:01:57.319 --> 00:01:59.223
Polly: Ahh!

19
00:01:59.224 --> 00:02:03.803
Wolf: Got you, you little nugget!

20
00:02:03.804 --> 00:02:13.385
Woodcutter: Not so fast, Wolf.

21
00:02:13.386 --> 00:02:21.678
Jack: The woodcutter is chasing away the wolf!

22
00:02:21.679 --> 00:02:32.571
Granny: You saved me.

23
00:02:32.572 --> 00:02:37.210
Jack: This is from Little Red,

24
00:02:37.211 --> 00:02:42.091
Granny. We hope you feel better soon.

25
00:02:42.092 --> 00:03:04.829
Granny: Thank you, dears.

26
00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:11.092
Omar: Nice work. It's almost picnic time.

27
00:03:11.093 --> 00:03:14.341
You should hurry back with the blanket. Polly:

28
00:03:14.342 --> 00:03:18.057
Yay! We can have pie at the picnic.

29
00:03:18.058 --> 00:03:21.463
Jack: There won't be any scary wolves there.

30
00:03:21.464 --> 00:03:30.953
Polly: Nope! Only a grumpy goose!

